    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u201dA zombie survival horror game set in a haunting Indonesian school. Combining atmospheric tension with a deeply engaging narrative, Project: JURIT explores the horrors of survival, friendship, and human nature in the face of a supernatural outbreak.\u201d</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deadly zombie outbreak has struck an old colonial school in Indonesia, and the government has imposed a strict quarantine, preventing students from leaving even if they are not infected. Trapped inside a school full of threats, a group of students must survive, uncover hidden mysteries, and decide who to trust. In this increasingly dark and tense world, every choice will determine their fate. Will they be able to escape or will they be trapped forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550400/extras/bdcd8a1d5f955e254f196ad8f899acb3.poster.avif?t=1755396848\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550400/extras/bdcd8a1d5f955e254f196ad8f899acb3.webm?t=1755396848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550400/extras/bdcd8a1d5f955e254f196ad8f899acb3.mp4?t=1755396848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre: Horror Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sub-Genre: Zombie Survival, Psychological Horror, Stealth-Based Survival, Narrative-Driven Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project: JURIT presents a survival experience in a zombie-infested school, with a focus on stealth strategy, resource management, and difficult decisions that affect the story. Players will feel the tension of horror while diving into the emotional relationships between characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550400/extras/6189f5c4bc4da05e1b3be517c0a52408.poster.avif?t=1755396848\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550400/extras/6189f5c4bc4da05e1b3be517c0a52408.webm?t=1755396848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550400/extras/6189f5c4bc4da05e1b3be517c0a52408.mp4?t=1755396848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Playable Characters: Three main characters with unique backgrounds, abilities, and perspectives, each providing a different gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth and Combat Mechanics: Players can choose to sneak past zombies or fight them using a variety of handcrafted weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management: Resources such as medicine, weapons, and crafting materials are limited, forcing players to make strategic decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Narrative: Player choices directly affect the storyline and determine the ending, including the possibility of getting a good or bad ending.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u201dA zombie survival horror game set in a haunting Indonesian school. Combining atmospheric tension with a deeply engaging narrative, Project: JURIT explores the horrors of survival, friendship, and human nature in the face of a supernatural outbreak.\u201d</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deadly zombie outbreak has struck an old colonial school in Indonesia, and the government has imposed a strict quarantine, preventing students from leaving even if they are not infected. Trapped inside a school full of threats, a group of students must survive, uncover hidden mysteries, and decide who to trust. In this increasingly dark and tense world, every choice will determine their fate. Will they be able to escape or will they be trapped forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550400/extras/bdcd8a1d5f955e254f196ad8f899acb3.poster.avif?t=1755396848\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550400/extras/bdcd8a1d5f955e254f196ad8f899acb3.webm?t=1755396848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550400/extras/bdcd8a1d5f955e254f196ad8f899acb3.mp4?t=1755396848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre: Horror Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sub-Genre: Zombie Survival, Psychological Horror, Stealth-Based Survival, Narrative-Driven Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project: JURIT presents a survival experience in a zombie-infested school, with a focus on stealth strategy, resource management, and difficult decisions that affect the story. Players will feel the tension of horror while diving into the emotional relationships between characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550400/extras/6189f5c4bc4da05e1b3be517c0a52408.poster.avif?t=1755396848\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550400/extras/6189f5c4bc4da05e1b3be517c0a52408.webm?t=1755396848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550400/extras/6189f5c4bc4da05e1b3be517c0a52408.mp4?t=1755396848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Playable Characters: Three main characters with unique backgrounds, abilities, and perspectives, each providing a different gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth and Combat Mechanics: Players can choose to sneak past zombies or fight them using a variety of handcrafted weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management: Resources such as medicine, weapons, and crafting materials are limited, forcing players to make strategic decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Narrative: Player choices directly affect the storyline and determine the ending, including the possibility of getting a good or bad ending.</p></li></ul>",
